+/* Function Name:
+ *      dal_rtl8373_cpu_awarePort_get
+ * Description:
+ *      Get CPU aware port mask.
+ * Input:
+ *      None
+ * Output:
+ *      pPortmask - Port mask.
+ * Return:
+ *      RT_ERR_OK               - OK
+ *      RT_ERR_FAILED           - Failed
+ *      RT_ERR_SMI              - SMI access error
+ * Note:
