+/* Function Name:
+ *      dal_rtl8373_asicRma_get
+ * Description:
+ *      Get reserved multicast address for CPU trapping
+ * Input:
+ *      index     - reserved multicast LSB byte, 0x00~0x2F is available value
+ *      rmacfg     - type of RMA for trapping frame type setting
