+/* Function Name:
+ *      dal_rtl8367c_storm_bypass_get
+ * Description:
+ *      Get bypass storm filter control configuration.
+ * Input:
+ *      type - Bypass storm filter control type.
+ * Output:
+ *      pEnable - Bypass status.
+ * Return:
+ *      RT_ERR_OK           - OK
