+/* Function Name:
+ *      phy_8224_ptp_PPSLatchTime_get
+ * Description:
+ *      Set toddelay.
+ * Input:
+ *      type    - accessType
+ * Output:
+ *      pLatchTime  - latch time
+ * Return:
